      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 211,
      "text": "There are some [hypocrites] who amaze you with their words in the life of this world and call upon Allah to witness what is in their heart, yet they are the fiercest opponents[103].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 204,
      "juz": 2,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 32,
      "ruku": 26,
      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 212,
      "text": "When they leave [you], they strive to spread corruption in the land[104] and destroy crops and livestock, whereas Allah does not like corruption.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 205,
      "juz": 2,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 32,
      "ruku": 26,
      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 213,
      "text": "When it is said to them, “Fear Allah,” pride takes hold of them to persist in sin. Hellfire is sufficient for them. What a terrible resting place!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 206,
      "juz": 2,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 32,
      "ruku": 26,
      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 214,
      "text": "But there are some people who sell their souls[105] to seek Allah’s pleasure, and Allah is Most Gracious to His slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 207,
      "juz": 2,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 32,
      "ruku": 26,
      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 215,
      "text": "O you who believe, enter into Islam completely and do not follow the footsteps of Satan, for He is your sworn enemy.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 208,
      "juz": 2,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 32,
      "ruku": 26,
      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 216,
      "text": "Should you slip back after the clear signs have come to you, then beware that Allah is All-Mighty, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 209,
      "juz": 2,
