      "page": 32,
      "ruku": 26,
      "hizbQuarter": 13,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 217,
      "text": "Are they waiting that Allah should come to them in the shadows of clouds[106], along with the angels? But then the matter would be decided. And to Allah return all matters.",
